   421|    <!-- PAGE 6: CAREER -->
   422|    <div class="page">
   423|        <div class="section-header">Vocation & Wealth</div>
   424|        <div class="chapter-title">Career & Wealth Path</div>
   425|        
   426|        <h3>Your Wealth Pattern</h3>
   427|        <p>
   428|            In BaZi, wealth is not only money. It is the <span class="emphasis">value you create and your capacity to receive it.</span>
   429|        </p>
   430|        <p>
   431|            Your chart shows that your strongest wealth potential comes from <span class="red-ink">intellectual property, strategic counsel, or creative problem-solving</span> — not from routine labor or a fixed salary. You are what the classics call an <span class="emphasis">"Indirect Wealth"</span> soul.
   432|        </p>
   433|        
   434|        <div class="master-note">
   435|            <div class="master-note-header">🖋 Reader's Reading</div>
   436|            <p>Indirect Wealth personalities thrive in open-ended situations where there is no fixed playbook. You are restless in jobs with rigid pay scales and no upside. Even if you are currently employed, you have an entrepreneurial mind. Your ideal income structure involves multiple streams: salary + consulting + royalties + equity.</p>
   437|        </div>
   438|        
   439|        <h3>Your Current Life Chapter</h3>
   440|        <p>
   441|            You are now in the <span class="red-ink">Gui Chou</span> Luck Pillar (ages 36–45). This is a Water-Earth cycle — a time of <span class="emphasis">consolidation, deep learning, and quiet accumulation.</span>
   442|        </p>
   443|        <p>
   444|            This is not a decade for reckless expansion. It is a season to sharpen your skills, clarify your reputation, and build assets that will mature in the next cycle. The seeds you plant now — a book, a course, a consulting practice, a portfolio — will bear fruit between ages 46 and 55.
   445|        </p>
   446|        
   447|        <h3>Practical Guidance</h3>
   448|        <ul>
   449|            <li><strong>Diversify your income.</strong> Do not rely on a single paycheck. Explore side projects or consulting.</li>
   450|            <li><strong>Build your name.</strong> Your ideas are valuable, but they must be seen. Writing, speaking, or teaching will serve you well.</li>
   451|            <li><strong>Partner with Earth-strong people.</strong> Find collaborators who excel in execution and detail. They will ground your vision.</li>
   452|        </ul>
   453|    </div>
   454|
   455|    <!-- PAGE 7: RELATIONSHIPS -->
   456|    <div class="page">
   457|        <div class="section-header">Human Connections</div>
   458|        <div class="chapter-title">Relationships & Love</div>
   459|        
   460|        <h3>Your Relationship Nature</h3>
   461|        <p>
   462|            Your Day Pillar suggests that you are <span class="emphasis">deeply loyal but selectively intimate.</span> You do not collect acquaintances. You maintain a small circle of people you truly trust, and you are fiercely protective of them.
   463|        </p>
   464|        <p>
   465|            In love, you are drawn to partners who are:
   466|        </p>
   467|        <ul>
   468|            <li>Intellectually stimulating</li>
   469|            <li>Emotionally stable (they provide the grounding you lack)</li>
   470|            <li>Independent enough to give you mental space</li>
   471|        </ul>
